          <declname>requirements</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Negotiate capabilities between a plugin and a list of requirements. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>For each requirement:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Checks that the named capability flag is enabled in the plugin.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Checks that the plugin version falls within the required version range.</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>plugin</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Plugin to inspect (via getVersion() / getCapabilities()). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>requirements</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>List of capability requirements to satisfy. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para><ref refid="structthemis_1_1plugins_1_1_plugin_negotiation_result" kindref="compound">PluginNegotiationResult</ref> with success flag and per-requirement details. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
