        <briefdescription>
<para>Check whether a plugin version satisfies a version range. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Uses semantic versioning (major.minor.patch). Non-parseable or empty version strings are treated as (0, 0, 0) and satisfy only unconstrained ranges.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>version</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Plugin version string (e.g. &quot;1.2.3&quot;). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>range</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Required version range. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>true if version satisfies range. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
