    <briefdescription>
<para>Runtime plugin capability negotiator. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Checks whether a plugin satisfies a set of PluginCapabilityRequirements, including version-range constraints on the plugin version.</para>
<para>Thread-Safety: All methods are stateless and thread-safe.</para>
<para>Example usage: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1plugins_1_1_plugin_capability_negotiator_1a11998fe126f1fbeaa76c2f45a2b1d92a" kindref="member">PluginCapabilityNegotiator::negotiate</ref>(plugin,<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>{</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;streaming&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>{</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;1.0.0&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">}},</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>{</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;gpu_accelerated&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/>{</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">}},</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">});</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
